    "detailed_description": "We Have To Let You Go is a puzzle RPG game about getting fired (literally) by your totalitarian dictator boss and going on a journey to stop his new business prospects to take over the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 sprawling chapters with plenty of secrets to uncover.</li><li>Classic Dragon Quest inspired battles with puzzle elements.</li><li>Over 20 unique abilities that offer constant creativity in battle.</li><li>Challenging boss fights that require skill and strategy to overcome.</li><li>A vital dodge mechanic that adds a risk and reward factor to combat.</li><li>A large cast of delightful characters to meet on your journey.</li><li>A cute and colorful pixel art style.</li><li>Several collectables and optional side quests.</li><li>An ever-changing soundtrack that develops throughout the adventure.</li></ul><br>We Have To Let You Go will release in 2025",
    "about_the_game": "We Have To Let You Go is a puzzle RPG game about getting fired (literally) by your totalitarian dictator boss and going on a journey to stop his new business prospects to take over the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 sprawling chapters with plenty of secrets to uncover.</li><li>Classic Dragon Quest inspired battles with puzzle elements.</li><li>Over 20 unique abilities that offer constant creativity in battle.</li><li>Challenging boss fights that require skill and strategy to overcome.</li><li>A vital dodge mechanic that adds a risk and reward factor to combat.</li><li>A large cast of delightful characters to meet on your journey.</li><li>A cute and colorful pixel art style.</li><li>Several collectables and optional side quests.</li><li>An ever-changing soundtrack that develops throughout the adventure.</li></ul><br>We Have To Let You Go will release in 2025",
    "short_description": "We Have To Let You Go is a puzzle RPG game created from the ground up using the RPG Maker engine. Players will traverse several vibrant worlds interconnected by an engrossing character-driven storyline, and a strategic battle system.",
